{"id":"a06ff8011d8167f1","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-extended-resolution.md","title":"Extended resolution with fresh acyclic gates","display":"df-extended-resolution — Extended resolution with fresh acyclic gates","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-extended-resolution","aliases":["72-df-extended-resolution"],"display":"df-extended-resolution — Extended resolution with fresh acyclic gates","depends_on":["[[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]","[[72-df-resolution-system]]"],"source_author":"Pavel Pudlák","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611; explicit finite acyclic-gate presentation","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_statement_status":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished","source_proof_status":"All gate inputs, freshness, finite unions and empty-gate case checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-extended-resolution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-extended-resolution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extended-resolution — Extended resolution with fresh acyclic gates"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" href=\"?note=1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" title=\"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses\">72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Pavel Pudlák"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611; explicit finite acyclic-gate presentation"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"All gate inputs, freshness, finite unions and empty-gate case checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是有限子句集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为有限命题变量集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(F)\\subseteq V\">\\(V(F)\\subseteq V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,r,\\mathcal G\">\\(D,r,\\mathcal G\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" href=\"?note=1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" title=\"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses\">72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\">\\(\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\langle(e_i,t_i,\\vec x_i):i&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal G^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(g=\\langle(e_i,t_i,\\vec x_i):i&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal G^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为有限子句序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}(g)\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}(g)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ERRefutation}\">\\(\\operatorname{ERRefutation}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ERRefutable}\">\\(\\operatorname{ERRefutable}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\bigl(e_i\\notin V\\cup\\{e_j:j&lt;i\\}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_i)\\subseteq V\\cup\\{e_j:j&lt;i\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\bigl(e_i\\notin V\\cup\\{e_j:j&lt;i\\}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_i)\\subseteq V\\cup\\{e_j:j&lt;i\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}(g):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}D(e_i,t_i,\\vec x_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Def}(g):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}D(e_i,t_i,\\vec x_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nV(F)\\subseteq V\\land\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\land\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F\\cup\\operatorname{Def}(g)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nV(F)\\subseteq V\\land\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\land\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F\\cup\\operatorname{Def}(g)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ERRefutable}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists V\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathsf{PV})\\;\n\\exists g\\in\\mathcal G^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ERRefutable}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists V\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathsf{PV})\\;\n\\exists g\\in\\mathcal G^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第VIII章 §8.4，印刷p.599/PDF p.611。此处将书中的公式定义变量写成按顺序引入的新门变量；每门只读旧变量，显式排除环和重用新名称。公式的子公式按树高排列，即给出上一Tseitin节点的实例；反过来可按门序展开出所定义的公式，表达语义一致。</p>\n<p>空门序列允许，因此普通归结是该接口的特例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 可含输入CNF之外的额外原变量，不影响可靠性。没有以公式完全展开后的大小来冒充门DAG的大小，也没有在此宣称扩展归结与扩展Frege的多项式模拟已被完整证明；书中该比较是另一个需要编码和构造核验的结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses","status":"resolved","id":"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses","status":"resolved","id":"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F$ 是有限子句集合；$V$ 为有限命题变量集合，$V(F)\\subseteq V$。$D,r,\\mathcal G$ 取 [[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F$ 是有限子句集合；$V$ 为有限命题变量集合，$V(F)\\subseteq V$。$D,r,\\mathcal G$ 取 [[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V(F)\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"D,r,\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResRefutation}","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\langle(e_i,t_i,\\vec x_i):i<m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal G^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}(g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ERRefutation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ERRefutable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall i<m\\;\\bigl(e_i\\notin V\\cup\\{e_j:j<i\\}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_i)\\subseteq V\\cup\\{e_j:j<i\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}(g):=\\bigcup_{i<m}D(e_i,t_i,\\vec x_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nV(F)\\subseteq V\\land\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\land\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F\\cup\\operatorname{Def}(g)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ERRefutable}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists V\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathsf{PV})\\;\n\\exists g\\in\\mathcal G^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{<\\omega}\\;\n\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g).","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":2857,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-358","l